WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
The takeaway is elegant.

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:07.457
Learn a differentiable permutation that arranges a
graph's nodes into a single row,

00:00:07.537 --> 00:00:12.528
and all the machinery of image convolution becomes
available for graphs.

00:00:12.608 --> 00:00:16.613
CoCN does exactly this, provably convergent and invariant,

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:19.008
reaching state-of-the-art results.

00:00:19.088 --> 00:00:22.600
Graphs, all in a row, can be convolved like images.
